  <activityDataset>
    <activityDescription>
      <activity id="cbb5e5c0-4293-52a6-8bc8-f23dd51df4bd" activityNameId="ea7a45bc-75ad-5449-aceb-db3947b3e3e0" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">Diesel, fossil, at regional storage</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Diesel, fossil, at regional storage
Inventory for the distribution of petroleum product to the final consumer (household, car, power plant, etc.) including all necessary transports. Shares of domestic production and imports calculated based on statistical data from the Swiss Petroleum Association (Erdölvereinigung) for 2020. Transport efforts estimated based on the transport distances and the means of transport for the relevant countries of origin.; UUID:2fd8b1cf-41c6-37ed-bfe7-c5f781e02e4d
Transportation of product from the refinery to the end user. Operation of storage tanks and petrol stations. Emissions from evaporation and treatment of effluents. Excluding emissions from car-washing at petrol stations.
Location: Supply in Switzerland
Technology: Distribution of petroleum products.
Time period: Actual data for transport distances and NMVOC emissions. Some information for the year 2000. Split up of NMVOC emissions published 1989.
Production volume: 3192000 t in 2021
Sampling: Environmental reports and literature.
Extrapolations: From single companies to average data.
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_2fd8b1cf-41c6-37ed-bfe7-c5f781e02e4d.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
      <geography geographyId="fdab769f-4bdb-5024-8349-c1745bbb2597" geographyContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83">
